1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,586
Hi. This is Selah Before Send—a private pause before a message leaves your hands.

2
00:00:06,586 --> 00:00:08,826
Here is the moment it was built for.

3
00:00:09,676 --> 00:00:13,365
A friend writes, “If this mattered to you, you would have shown up.”

4
00:00:13,366 --> 00:00:16,458
You fire back, “You have no idea what I was carrying.”

5
00:00:16,458 --> 00:00:18,339
Your cursor reaches Send.

6
00:00:18,936 --> 00:00:20,227
Tap Pause.

7
00:00:21,532 --> 00:00:24,725
First, Gloo reads the heat—not who is right.

8
00:00:24,726 --> 00:00:27,905
Here it sees defensiveness, and a need to be understood.

9
00:00:27,905 --> 00:00:30,046
That selects a pre-approved theme.

10
00:00:30,046 --> 00:00:34,180
YouVersion returns the exact passage and its wider context.

11
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:37,014
The model never chooses or invents Scripture.

12
00:00:37,664 --> 00:00:40,508
Then Selah asks one private question.

13
00:00:40,509 --> 00:00:43,927
It never writes the reply, and it never posts for you.

14
00:00:43,927 --> 00:00:45,841
Edit in your own words.

15
00:00:45,841 --> 00:00:47,333
Wait ten minutes.

16
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,685
Or send anyway.

17
00:00:48,685 --> 00:00:51,389
Your voice—and your choice—stay yours.

18
00:00:52,116 --> 00:00:57,997
And if the message is more than angry, Selah does not answer a crisis with a verse.

19
00:00:58,368 --> 00:00:59,727
It stops.

20
00:01:00,334 --> 00:01:02,202
No Scripture retrieval.

21
00:01:02,203 --> 00:01:03,612
No reflection.

22
00:01:03,612 --> 00:01:06,323
It points toward immediate human help.

23
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:12,663
Every step has a fixed structure, and if anything fails, the system stops safely.

24
00:01:12,664 --> 00:01:18,038
Gloo classifies, YouVersion retrieves, and Gloo reflects using only the returned text.

25
00:01:18,754 --> 00:01:21,859
Selah doesn’t ask technology to speak for you.

26
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:27,190
It gives you one quiet moment to decide who you want to be—before your words leave your hands.
